{"nodes":[{"id":"a5b1c1d1e1f10001","type":"text","text":"# Linux用户权限\n\n**模块说明**：用户/组/UGO/SUID/ACL/提权\n\n— 1 个笔记 —","x":-110,"y":-200,"width":260,"height":60,"color":"4"},{"id":"a5b1c1d1e1f10002","type":"file","file":"user-permission.md","x":-130,"y":-50,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"a5b1c1d1e1f10003","type":"text","text":"user-permission.md\n─────\n• §0 心智模型：Linux 权限 = 你是谁 + 文件给你什么\n• §1 用户分类\n• §2 /etc/passwd\n• §3 /etc/group\n• §4 用户管理\n• §5 组管理\n• §6 /etc/login.defs 和 /etc/skel/\n• §7 文件权限基础 rwx × ugo\n• §8 chmod 字符法 + 数字法\n• §9 chown / chgrp\n• §10 umask\n• §11 SUID\n• §12 SGID\n• §13 sticky 粘滞位\n• §14 ACL 访问控制列表\n• §15 chattr\n• §16 提权基础 su vs su -\n• §17 提权核心 sudo\n• §18 实战：白名单授权 + 审计\n• §19 速查表\n• §20 易错点\n• §21 面试追问\n• §22 链路","x":200,"y":-200,"width":380,"height":550}],"edges":[{"id":"e5b1c1d1e1f10001","fromNode":"a5b1c1d1e1f10001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"a5b1c1d1e1f10002","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e5b1c1d1e1f10002","fromNode":"a5b1c1d1e1f10002","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a5b1c1d1e1f10003","toSide":"left"}]}
